<title>USA: Richton Q4 shr loss $0.10 vs loss $0.11.</title>
<headline>Richton Q4 shr loss $0.10 vs loss $0.11.</headline>
<dateline>MADISON, N.J. 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr loss	  $0.10	     loss $0.11</p>
<p> Net loss	  330		 loss 347</p>
<p> Sales	     16,725		   13,565</p>
<p>	  12 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr profit	$0.54	   profit $0.43</p>
<p> Net profit	1,765	   profit 1,364</p>
<p> Sales	     87,740		   66,659</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Full company name is Richton International Corp.</p>
<p>Company said a large share of its sales was seasonal and as a result the fourth quarter usually showed a loss.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610))</p>
